            "review_title": "Review at Chateau Fusion Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Joel K\nVancouver, Canada3584 contributions\n0\nTourists .... Lunch fixed menu ... Not bad food\nNov 2019\nWe had quite fixed menu of food at the Chateau. We started with deep fried vegetables, followed by Chicken soup in coconut. I had Seabass filet with passion sauce and my wife grilled honey Chicken with potato wedges. Both were tasty and good. We shared fried rice with vegetables and sauted vegetable with garlic. Dessert was fresh mixed fruit salad. We also ordered drinks. The fixed menu was tasty, good, fresh ingredients. Service was good. Ambiance was quite nice.\nRead more\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 13, 2020",
